      "t": "Будет сделано, мой босс.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's examine this conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Посмотри на это видео.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look at this video.' Nagiyev immediately shoves a video in his chef's face.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я не понимаю. Я уволен?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't understand. Am I fired?' Barinov starts to object or express confusion.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Нет, ты звезда!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, you are a star!' Nagiyev excitedly declares that Viktor is now famous.",
      "gap": 0.4
