    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Почему я звезда?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why am I a star?' Barinov is totally confused as to why he would be considered a star.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "У видео миллион просмотров.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The video has a million views.' Nagiyev explains the massive online success of the clip.",
